# Generated source, SEO, live HTTP and editorial publishing previews.
# GitHub Actions uploads these separately as short-lived build artifacts.
# Ignoring reports prevents accidental commits; deployment tooling must also
# explicitly EXCLUDE this directory from 123-reg's public web root.
/reports/
/anybike-*-audit.json
/anybike-*-preview.json
/anybike-*-summary.json

# Local credentials and authorised backend-only data exports.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*service-role*.json
*service_role*.json
/private-export*.json

# Local JS packages, OS and editor detritus.
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
